        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "xjIRj",
          "name": "Section description",
          "fill": "$cj-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "THIS FILE  /  Design-system reference. Edit approved pages in catchingjobs-website.pen (15 page rows), not here. The website retains local supporting master copies; edits are NOT automatically cross-file synced.\n\n01 Foundations  iLHQu   ·   02 Components  z4o81y   ·   03 Icons  c74Md / Slvha / FXigp / uxTwZ\n04 Illustrations  OwNNo / gXyL4 / M3oZ1E / X75Jo   ·   05 Patterns  qiaDD / L2zCmt / oKbf2\nControls  Y4sQm   ·   Original 26 guide  lyuNM   ·   Compatibility header masters inside z4o81y.\n\nThe externally managed Lunaris import remains outside this working library.",
          "fontFamily": "$cj-font-body",
          "fontSize": 18,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
