          "name": "Motion usage and reduced motion",
          "fill": "$cj-ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Controls: 160ms ease-out for state changes. Scene: up to650ms for a single decorative reveal.\nKeep title contrast fields, copy and actions static and visible from the first frame.\nNo continuous loops. Never delay a job search or application to finish an animation.\nReduced motion: show the complete illustration immediately and disable decorative movement.\nThe canvas is a visual specification; keyboard interaction, announcements and focus management are implemented and tested in code.",
          "fontFamily": "Geist",
          "fontSize": 18,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
